OL,3,AHigher fuel prices push UK inflation to
OL,4,A3.6%
OL,5,
OL,6,FGlobal oil prices have surged in recent
OL,7,Fmonths due to the US-Iran war, with the
OL,8,FBank of England raising nterest rates
OL,9,Ffor the first time in three years
OL,10,Fearlier this month in a bid to slow
OL,11,Fprice rises.
